 the Harbingers of Avalon out of the Union.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I actually think that's where I'm going in my campaign. As the President eliminates whole government agencies, former sources of funding are lost. The Syndicate begins flexing their authority, pressing the Enlightened to profitable ventures and away from other research. Projects that are to protect the world from existential threats are neglected. Extraordinary Citizens are laid off. Eventually, the Harbingers say, &quot;That's enough!&quot;<br /> Then some sort of secret being revealed could trigger them to act.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-19T14:26:49-07:00","id":1081075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GogariGlenRoss</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1076247-harbingers-of-avalon#post1076247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think where my chronicle is going, the Technocracy splinter faction The Harbingers of Avalon are going to play a bigger role soon.<br /> <br /> In your personal canon, what would it take for the Harbingers to finally split from the Technocratic Union? What would be the last straw?</div> </div> </div> </div